* =========================================================
* B57153S0100M000
* TDK/EPCOS S153/10 M
* Simplified simulation model
*
* R25 nominal = 10 ohm
* This model represents the COLD NTC resistance.
* It does NOT model self-heating.
* =========================================================

.SUBCKT B57153S0100M000 1 2
RNTC 1 2 10
.ENDS B57153S0100M000
